shop: A shop: its orders and its stock, the program tests\packages.ps1 lists with kppc --packages.
  main.kpp: functions main
shop/orders: Orders and their lines, written over two lines of the README.
  Order.kpp: types Order, OrderState, OrderId; functions orderCount; variables maxOrders
shop/orders/detail
  Codes.kpp: namespaces codes
shop/stock
  Item.kpp: types Item
shop/tools
shop/tools/lint
  Lint.kpp: functions lintPassed
vendor
